title Study Planner System - use cases
left to right direction
actor Student
rectangle "Study Planner System" {
  usecase "UC1\nManage courses" as UC1
  usecase "UC2\nManage academic items" as UC2
  usecase "UC3\nGenerate schedule" as UC3
  usecase "UC4\nDetect conflicts" as UC4
  usecase "UC5\nTrack daily progress" as UC5
